ent creators, detailing channels, and automotive Instagram/TikTok accounts. Share your affiliate link in posts, reels, videos, or bio links.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Other information:</strong>Niche audience, high intent buyers. Register at af.uppromote.com/bimmerkraft/register or reach out at <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BimmerKraftAffiliate@gmail.com</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><div class=\"text-text-300\"><div class=\"text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between\"><div class=\"w-fit\"><div class=\"relative text-text-500 group-hover/btn:text-text-100\"><div class=\"transition-all opacity-100 scale-100\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 transition-all opacity-0 scale-50\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;\"><br></div></div></div><div class=\"w-fit\"><div class=\"text-text-500 group-hover/btn:text-text-100\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\"><br></div></div><div class=\"w-fit\"><div class=\"text-text-500 group-hover/btn:text-text-100\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\"><br></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center\"><div class=\"w-fit\"><div class=\"text-text-500 group-hover/btn:text-text-100\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"h-px w-full pointer-events-none\"><br></div><div class=\"ml-1 flex items-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-out mt-6\"><div class=\"p-1 -translate-x-px\"><div><div class=\"w-8 text-accent-brand inline-block select-none\"><br></div></div></div></div><div class=\"h-12\"><br></div></div></div>",
